{"3936030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Visit Azores", "steam_appid": 3936030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey to the heart of the Atlantic with Visit Azores, a groundbreaking Virtual Reality experience that lets you explore the breathtaking island of São Miguel like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This immersive standalone app transforms your living room into a gateway to volcanic craters, emerald valleys, and windswept coastlines, all captured in stunning 360° 3D video.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/extras/61911643367cf04d156f741785ebfd31.avif?t=1757352628\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/extras_big/61911643367cf04d156f741785ebfd31.webp?t=1757352628 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re yearning to wander around the Sete Cidades caldera, feel the mist at Salto do Cabrito waterfall, stand beneath the arches of the Ponte dos Oito Arcos, or take in the surreal beauty of the abandoned Monte Palace Hotel overlooking Lagoa das Sete Cidades, this app places you there with a sense of realism and presence only VR can deliver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/extras/10282e6a21e539566efaf67876d603f7.avif?t=1757352628\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/extras_big/10282e6a21e539566efaf67876d603f7.webp?t=1757352628 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each destination includes optional multi-language audio guides rich with cultural, historical, and natural insight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/extras/fe54987a8f89fac5524e61adfa47582d.avif?t=1757352628\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/extras_big/fe54987a8f89fac5524e61adfa47582d.avif?t=1757352628 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’d rather unwind, you can enjoy each location with soothing ambient music or simply soak in the natural spatial sounds: ocean waves, chirping birds, rustling leaves, and the subtle hum of geothermal springs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/extras/05d2ad1b3bcccef9c4dcd4bd2578b946.avif?t=1757352628\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/extras_big/05d2ad1b3bcccef9c4dcd4bd2578b946.webp?t=1757352628 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The app’s auto-move feature ensures that everyone, including elderly users or those with limited mobility, coordination or wheelchair users can explore effortlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/extras/8079e67eaa576d3e41be319b904c55b3.avif?t=1757352628\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/extras_big/8079e67eaa576d3e41be319b904c55b3.webp?t=1757352628 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have done also some urban exploring and visited an abandoned Hotel and what remained from an old power plant in the woods. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/extras/af22342b3dda56c4b0ade2ee7d4a3796.avif?t=1757352628\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/extras_big/af22342b3dda56c4b0ade2ee7d4a3796.webp?t=1757352628 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose any from the many locations on the map and on each location view up to 12 different views full in 360 3D videos. You can also try the auto mode and just sit back an relax by going automatically through all the locations. This mode is really useful by elderly people, so they do not have to use the controllers at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/extras/3d7bfd2adc56fa8ce401ff98f245572f.avif?t=1757352628\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/extras_big/3d7bfd2adc56fa8ce401ff98f245572f.webp?t=1757352628 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy your next holiday right now on Azores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey to the heart of the Atlantic with Visit Azores, a groundbreaking Virtual Reality experience that lets you explore the breathtaking island of São Miguel like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This immersive standalone app transforms your living room into a gateway to volcanic craters, emerald valleys, and windswept coastlines, all captured in stunning 360° 3D video.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/extras/61911643367cf04d156f741785ebfd31.avif?t=1757352628\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/extras_big/61911643367cf04d156f741785ebfd31.webp?t=1757352628 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re yearning to wander around the Sete Cidades caldera, feel the mist at Salto do Cabrito waterfall, stand beneath the arches of the Ponte dos Oito Arcos, or take in the surreal beauty of the abandoned Monte Palace Hotel overlooking Lagoa das Sete Cidades, this app places you there with a sense of realism and presence only VR can deliver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/extras/10282e6a21e539566efaf67876d603f7.avif?t=1757352628\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/extras_big/10282e6a21e539566efaf67876d603f7.webp?t=1757352628 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each destination includes optional multi-language audio guides rich with cultural, historical, and natural insight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/extras/fe54987a8f89fac5524e61adfa47582d.avif?t=1757352628\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/extras_big/fe54987a8f89fac5524e61adfa47582d.avif?t=1757352628 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’d rather unwind, you can enjoy each location with soothing ambient music or simply soak in the natural spatial sounds: ocean waves, chirping birds, rustling leaves, and the subtle hum of geothermal springs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/extras/05d2ad1b3bcccef9c4dcd4bd2578b946.avif?t=1757352628\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/extras_big/05d2ad1b3bcccef9c4dcd4bd2578b946.webp?t=1757352628 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The app’s auto-move feature ensures that everyone, including elderly users or those with limited mobility, coordination or wheelchair users can explore effortlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/extras/8079e67eaa576d3e41be319b904c55b3.avif?t=1757352628\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/extras_big/8079e67eaa576d3e41be319b904c55b3.webp?t=1757352628 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have done also some urban exploring and visited an abandoned Hotel and what remained from an old power plant in the woods. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/extras/af22342b3dda56c4b0ade2ee7d4a3796.avif?t=1757352628\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/extras_big/af22342b3dda56c4b0ade2ee7d4a3796.webp?t=1757352628 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose any from the many locations on the map and on each location view up to 12 different views full in 360 3D videos. You can also try the auto mode and just sit back an relax by going automatically through all the locations. This mode is really useful by elderly people, so they do not have to use the controllers at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/extras/3d7bfd2adc56fa8ce401ff98f245572f.avif?t=1757352628\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/extras_big/3d7bfd2adc56fa8ce401ff98f245572f.webp?t=1757352628 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy your next holiday right now on Azores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Discover São Miguel like never before with Visit Azores, the immersive VR travel experience that brings the breathtaking beauty of the Azores straight to your Headset. Step into 360° 3D videos and explore stunning landscapes—volcanic lakes, waterfalls, tea plantations, coastal cliffs, and more.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/56930db9aa3442fc3c17332901619afeb0af2ae7/header.jpg?t=1757352628", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/b23e0a0d0fb690bee42c03fb5d3ebb7021003a67/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757352628", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936030/b23e0a0d0fb690bee42c03fb5d3ebb7021003a67/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757352628", "website": "https://npsoftware.at/index.php/portfolio/visit-azores/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR </li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Peter Nagy"], "publishers": ["NP Software"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 899, "final": 899, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$8.99"}, "packages": [1382736], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Visit Azores", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1382736, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "Visit Azores - $8.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 899}]}], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 52, "description": "Tracked Controller Support"}, {"